<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">One Night Only: Dethklok Plays Etheria</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;
  &lt;i&gt;"So let me get this straight. You," Nathan pointed at the Etherians, "are all aliens who live in a magical kingdom and you're in a war with a galactic overlord."&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
  &lt;i&gt;"That's the gist of it, I guess," nodded Bow, putting a spoonful of borscht in his mouth.&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
  &lt;i&gt;"And she is a magical warrior that turns into a ten foot tall super warrior with a massive sword?"&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
  &lt;i&gt;"Yeah?"&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
  &lt;i&gt; "So you're fighting space battles with a sword?" asked Pickles.&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
  &lt;i&gt;"I guess?"&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
  &lt;i&gt;"That's metal," said Nathan. Entire Dethklok nodded in agreement.&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
  &lt;i&gt;"I think that means it's a good thing," Glimmer whispered into Adora's ear. Adora beamed.&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;hr /&gt;&lt;p&gt;After a very drunken night, Dethklok finds themselves on Etheria. Once they find out about Horde Prime's invasion and the consequences thereof, they decide to do what they do best - to put on a metal show.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Â &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;An r/OkBuddyCatra crack fic.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>AthenasLilOwl</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
